{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e208d6006945d28013a4","chatId":"4e026090a4c94421a0ce9a5f23b32832","sessionId":null,"userId":57787,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"[[A]]","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"[[A]]","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":880,"promptTokens":1536,"completionTokens":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:33:28"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.005220126312597489,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e208d6006945d28013a3","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794368008654,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:33:28","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e208d6006945d28013a3","chatId":"4e026090a4c94421a0ce9a5f23b32832","sessionId":null,"userId":57787,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"下面给你提供一段故事，一个问题和若干答案选项，请你根据故事内容和给定的问题，按照常理推测，选择一个最可能的答案选项，并输出答案序号。\n注意：\n（1）请只输出最可能的答案序号，格式为：[[答案序号]]，例如，最可能的答案选项为“A. 手提包”，则输出“[[A]]”；\n（2）请必须从给定的答案选项“A、B、C、D”中选择一个做为最可能的答案作为输出，无论故事中是否提供足够的信息，如果你认为故事里没有足够的信息选出答案，请随机输出“[[A]]”，“[[B]]”，“[[C]]”，“[[D]]”其中之一；\n（3）请只输出在给定的信息下最可能的答案序号，不要输出其他内容。\n\n[故事]\n乔乔是班长，婷婷是她最好的朋友，玲玲是她们班级的新生。乔乔正在为周末的派对准备，她看着手中的邀请名单，在婷婷的名字下方加上了玲玲的名字。婷婷看到乔乔写了玲玲的名字，她瞪了一眼乔乔，转过头不再说话。然后，乔乔看了看婷婷，又看了看玲玲，还是决定发出邀请。玲玲收到邀请时，她看到了乔乔和婷婷之间的眼神交流。\n\n[问题]\n乔乔为什么会不顾婷婷的态度，还是决定邀请玲玲？\n\n[答案选项]\nA. 乔乔是班长，责任心占了上风，他想让玲玲通过派对快点融入班级。\nB. 乔乔想通过邀请玲玲来对婷婷进行挑衅。\nC. 乔乔想和玲玲在派对上共度愉快的时光。\nD. 乔乔觉得邀请更多的人会让派对更有趣。","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.005220126312597489,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e208d6006945d28013a4","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794368008651,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:33:28","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"a239c12a72fc40e49744a301c06f300e"}